      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "IRON WORKS (2) boasts a strong record this journey here with 16 wins and four minors from 27 tries. Recorded a half a length win (42.38) in a Free For All last time at this track. Has the ability and looks a key chance here. MISS ENVY (8) goes very well here starting 29 times for 14 wins and 11 minors. Recorded a 1.5 lengths win (41.43) in a OPEN last time at Q Parklands. Looks one of the chances. BURNALI (1) continues to race well but is struggling to break through, placing at her last five runs. Last time finished 3rd on August 8 over 715m at this track behind West On Menace beaten 3.5 lengths (43.21) in a Grade 5. Ran one of the fastest times on the program last start despite finishing in the minors. Hard to beat again. WEST ON MODEL (7) was out of placings last time (35.45) at this track in a Free For All, finishing fourth and beaten 1.5 lengths. Loves this draw, having won three of five starts.",
